    "title": "Bitcoin is Vanishing into “Deep Storage” Faster than Miners Make It",
    "link": "https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-is-vanishing-into-deep-storage-faster-than-miners-make-it",
    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rWfTVQTY8vU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/rWfTVQTY8vU/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/bitcoin-is-vanishing-into-deep-storage-faster-than-miners-make-it-rWfTVQTY8vU.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-is-vanishing-into-deep-storage-faster-than-miners-make-it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin is Vanishing into “Deep Storage” Faster than Miners Make It</a></p>\n<p>Miners produce about 450 new Bitcoin a day, but over the past year about 630 a day moved into wallets dormant for 10 years.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-is-vanishing-into-deep-storage-faster-than-miners-make-it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin is Vanishing into “Deep Storage” Faster than Miners Make It</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
    "description": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rWfTVQTY8vU\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/rWfTVQTY8vU/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/bitcoin-is-vanishing-into-deep-storage-faster-than-miners-make-it-rWfTVQTY8vU.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-is-vanishing-into-deep-storage-faster-than-miners-make-it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin is Vanishing into “Deep Storage” Faster than Miners Make It</a></p>\n<p>Miners produce about 450 new Bitcoin a day, but over the past year about 630 a day moved into wallets dormant for 10 years.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/bitcoin-is-vanishing-into-deep-storage-faster-than-miners-make-it\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin is Vanishing into “Deep Storage” Faster than Miners Make It</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
